4. What changed
The plugin manifest, slash commands, subagents, hooks and marketplace files
are not distributed here. Their behaviour is reimplemented as one SKILL.md
workflow and four Python scripts written for this repository. docs/design.md
records the mapping and the parts that could not be carried over.

5. Carve-outs
UPSTREAM_FILES.txt is generated by tools/build.py. dist/, .cache/ and
__pycache__/ are build outputs, not distributed content. skill/SKILL.md,
skill/references/workbuddy.md, skill/references/INDEX.md, the four scripts
other than nlpm-check.py, and everything under docs/, tools/ and tests/ are
authored in this repository.

